@* 공개 팀 홈 ① 소개 탭 마지막 섹션 "팀 소식" (SPEC.TEAMPUBLICHOME ① + Design.TeamBoard 연동).
   공개(IsPublic) 글만 카드형 최대 3건(제목 + 날짜 + 본문 3줄 미리보기). 3건 초과 시 "지난 소식 보기"로
   같은 탭 내 확장(#news). 유형 뱃지 없음(전부 "소식"). 첨부는 파일명만(다운로드는 로그인 필요).
   **공개 글 0건이면 섹션 자체를 렌더하지 않는다**(방문자 빈 상태 금지). PC·모바일 공용(반응형 단일 마크업). *@
@using PlayGround.Client.Styles
@using PlayGround.Contracts.Team
@inject TeamClient Teams

@if (mNews is { Count: > 0 })
{
    <div id="news" class="@($"{Css.Dashboard.Card} p-6 md:p-[30px] flex flex-col gap-[18px]")">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
            <h2 class="m-0 text-[17px] md:text-[19px] font-extrabold text-navy-deep">@AppText.Team.NewsTitle</h2>
            <span class="text-[13px] text-text-muted break-keep">@AppText.Team.NewsSubtitle</span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            @foreach (TeamNewsDto item in Visible)
            {
                <div class="border border-border rounded-[14px] p-4 md:p-5 flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <span class="text-[15px] font-extrabold text-navy-deep break-keep">@item.Title</span>
                    <span class="text-[11.5px] text-text-muted whitespace-nowrap">@item.CreatedAt.ToLocalTime().ToString("yyyy.M.d")</span>
                    <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-[13.5px] text-text-strong leading-[1.65] break-keep line-clamp-3">@item.Body</p>
                    @if (item.Files.Count > 0)
                    {
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mt-1.5">
                            @foreach (TeamNewsFileDto file in item.Files)
                            {
                                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] text-text-muted whitespace-nowrap">
                                    <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.5 3H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7.5z"></path><path d="M14 3v5h5"></path></svg>
                                    @file.FileName
                                </span>
                            }
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-text-faint break-keep">@AppText.Team.NewsAttachNote</span>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            }
        </div>

        @if (mNews.Count > PreviewCount && !mExpanded)
        {
            <button type="button" class="self-start text-[13px] font-bold text-navy hover:text-orange-ink bg-transparent border-0 cursor-pointer p-0"
                    @onclick="() => mExpanded = true">@AppText.Team.NewsMore(mNews.Count - PreviewCount)</button>
        }
    </div>
}

@code {
    private const int PreviewCount = 3;

    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string Slug { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    private List<TeamNewsDto>? mNews;
    private bool mExpanded;

    private List<TeamNewsDto> Visible =>
        mExpanded ? mNews! : mNews!.Take(PreviewCount).ToList();

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Slug))
        {
            return;
        }

        TeamNewsResponse? response = await Teams.GetTeamNewsAsync(Slug);
        mNews = response?.Items ?? new List<TeamNewsDto>();
    }
}
